# Changelog discipline

BambuFarmer uses [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) in [`CHANGELOG.md`](CHANGELOG.md).

## When landing work

For any **user-visible**, **API**, **CLI**, **deploy**, or **ops** change in the same change set:

1. Edit `CHANGELOG.md` under `## [Unreleased]`.
2. Use categories: `Added`, `Changed`, `Fixed`, `Deprecated`, `Removed`, `Security`.
3. One short bullet per notable item (why/impact, not a file list).
4. Skip pure renames/refactors with no behavior change unless they affect operators (paths, env, CLI).

## When releasing

1. Move `[Unreleased]` bullets into a new `## [X.Y.Z] — YYYY-MM-DD`.
2. Leave an empty `## [Unreleased]` section at the top.
3. Bump `VERSION` to `X.Y.Z` and update compare links at the bottom of `CHANGELOG.md`.
4. Tag `vX.Y.Z` (release workflow extracts that section for GitHub Release notes).

Do not invent version bumps unless the user asked to release.
